 :answer/value "8" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-bcd116c0-6c77-5a3a-aa4a-fdb222617782" :question/id #uuid "bcd116c0-6c77-5a3a-aa4a-fdb222617782" :question/math-academy-id "q-224155" :question/problem "What is the value of $5$ raised to the second power?\n\n$5$ raised to the second power is\n{{field-1}}." :question/worked-solution "We need to evaluate ${5}^{2}.$\n\nTo evaluate ${5}^{2},$ we write it out with multiplication signs and then compute the product:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{5}^{2}={{5\\times 5}_{⏟}}_{2\\text{ times}}=25\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-73b21d48-ef5b-59c7-9604-5dd35409ebeb"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-73b21d48-ef5b-59c7-9604-5dd35409ebeb" :answer-field/id #uuid "73b21d48-ef5b-59c7-9604-5dd35409ebeb" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "answer-1d948b5b-dd97-5d11-b93e-08eb900432e7" :answer-field/choices ["answer-1d948b5b-dd97-5d11-b93e-08eb900432e7"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-1d948b5b-dd97-5d11-b93e-08eb900432e7" :answer/id #uuid "1d948b5b-dd97-5d11-b93e-08eb900432e7" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "25" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-67f4609a-bf5e-5370-a6dc-848f8c2f3fef" :question/id #uuid "67f4609a-bf5e-5370-a6dc-848f8c2f3fef" :question/math-academy-id "q-55034" :question/problem "What is the value of $9$ raised to the power of $3?$" :question/worked-solution "Here, $9$ raised to the power of $3$ means ${9}^{3}.$\n\nTo compute this power, we start by writing it out with multiplication signs:\n\n$$\n{9}^{3}={{9\\times 9\\times 9}_{⏟}}_{3\\text{ times}}\n$$\n\nNow, we compute the product. Since $9\\times 9=81,$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{{9\\times 9}_{⏟}}_{81}\\times 9 & =81\\times 9.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we work out $81\\times 9.$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{aligned} &  & \\,\\,\\,\\,{}_{}\\,\\,\\,\\, &  \\\\  &  & \\,\\,\\,\\,8\\,\\,\\,\\, & \\,\\,\\,\\,1\\,\\,\\,\\, \\\\ \\,\\,\\,\\,\\times \\,\\,\\,\\, & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\, &  & \\,\\,\\,\\,9\\,\\,\\,\\, \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,7\\,\\,\\,\\, & \\,\\,\\,\\,2\\,\\,\\,\\, & \\,\\,\\,\\,9\\,\\,\\,\\,\\end{aligned} \\\\  & \\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince $81\\times 9=729,$ then ${9}^{3}=729.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-735a999b-8273-5ba0-b1f3-8563ca74e9aa"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-735a999b-8273-5ba0-b1f3-8563ca74e9aa" :answer-field/id #uuid "735a999b-8273-5ba0-b1f3-8563ca74e9aa" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-ce5b4677-1bee-590e-b106-43f64807b3ad" :answer-field/choices ["answer-97721b92-93f3-5c95-850a-66712f9d0497" "answer-18041424-7e1f-5d6e-be15-3870a03e5c9f" "answer-ce5b4677-1bee-590e-b106-43f64807b3ad" "answer-8b28324e-c5bd-519d-b0e7-b9bad2e7917f" "answer-49e664f1-f0e5-51f0-b485-e375c7890a45"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-97721b92-93f3-5c95-850a-66712f9d0497" :answer/id #uuid "97721b92-93f3-5c95-850a-66712f9d0497" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "12" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-18041424-7e1f-5d6e-be15-3870a03e5c9f" :answer/id #uuid "18041424-7e1f-5d6e-be15-3870a03e5c9f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "27" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-ce5b4677-1bee-590e-b106-43f64807b3ad" :answer/id #uuid "ce5b4677-1bee-590e-b106-43f64807b3ad" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "729" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-8b28324e-c5bd-519d-b0e7-b9bad2e7917f" :answer/id #uuid "8b28324e-c5bd-519d-b0e7-b9bad2e7917f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "93" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-49e664f1-f0e5-51f0-b485-e375c7890a45" :answer/id #uuid "49e664f1-f0e5-51f0-b485-e375c7890a45" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "999" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-ca59627a-61c0-5ddb-824a-6032d58fc249" :question/id #uuid "ca59627a-61c0-5ddb-824a-6032d58fc249" :question/math-academy-id "q-224166" :question/problem "What is the cube of $10?$\n\nThe cube of $10$ is\n{{field-1}}." :question/worked-solution "We need to evaluate ${10}^{3}.$\n\nTo evaluate ${10}^{3},$ we start by writing it out with multiplication signs:\n\n$$\n{10}^{3}={{10\\times 10\\times 10}_{⏟}}_{3\\text{ times}}\n$$\n\nNow, we compute the product. Since $10\\times 10=100,$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{{10\\times 10}_{⏟}}_{100}\\times 10 & =100\\times 10.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, since $100\\times 10=1,000,$ we have ${10}^{3}=1,000.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-b627d9b0-6f9a-5bc3-8cd4-7fa1d463579b"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-b627d9b0-6f9a-5bc3-8cd4-7fa1d463579b" :answer-field/id #uuid "b627d9b0-6f9a-5bc3-8cd4-7fa1d463579b" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "answer-6792c553-6e2b-568a-a85a-3229229b1c1b" :answer-field/choices ["answer-6792c553-6e2b-568a-a85a-3229229b1c1b"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-6792c553-6e2b-568a-a85a-3229229b1c1b" :answer/id #uuid "6792c553-6e2b-568a-a85a-3229229b1c1b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "1,000" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-ef349707-5a77-5407-8660-293dceb041c2" :question/id #uuid "ef349707-5a77-5407-8660-293dceb041c2" :question/math-academy-id "q-224181" :question/problem "What is the value of $4$ raised to the power of $3?$\n\n$4$ raised to the power of $3$ is\n{{field-1}}." :question/worked-solution "We need to evaluate ${4}^{3}.$\n\nTo evaluate ${4}^{3},$ we start by writing it out with multiplication signs:\n\n$$\n{4}^{3}={{4\\times 4\\times 4}_{⏟}}_{3\\text{ times}}\n$$\n\nNow, we compute the product. Since $4\\times 4=16,$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{{4\\times 4}_{⏟}}_{16}\\times 4 & =16\\times 4.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we work out $16\\times 4.$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{aligned} & \\,\\,\\,\\,{}_{2}\\,\\,\\,\\, &  \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,1\\,\\,\\,\\, & \\,\\,\\,\\,6\\,\\,\\,\\, \\\\ \\,\\,\\,\\,\\times \\,\\,\\,\\, &  & \\,\\,\\,\\,4\\,\\,\\,\\, \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,6\\,\\,\\,\\, & \\,\\,\\,\\,4\\,\\,\\,\\,\\end{aligned} \\\\  & \\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince $16\\times 4=64,$ we have ${4}^{3}=64.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-a4629054-af30-504c-aa6d-3ff14abcce10"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-a4629054-af30-504c-aa6d-3ff14abcce10" :answer-field/id #uuid "a4629054-af30-504c-aa6d-3ff14abcce10" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "answer-ec592311-90d1-559e-b5ba-bf63040fd157" :answer-field/choices ["answer-ec592311-90d1-559e-b5ba-bf63040fd157"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-ec592311-90d1-559e-b5ba-bf63040fd157" :answer/id #uuid "ec592311-90d1-559e-b5ba-bf63040fd157" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "64" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-3b68262c-4f64-5130-a6e1-d1cb3e865a03" :question/id #uuid "3b68262c-4f64-5130-a6e1-d1cb3e865a03" :question/math-academy-id "q-224035" :question/problem "What is the value of $7$ raised to the power of $3?$\n\n$7$ raised to the power of $3$ is\n{{field-1}}." :question/worked-solution "We need to evaluate ${7}^{3}.$\n\nTo evaluate ${7}^{3},$ we start by writing it out with multiplication signs:\n\n$$\n{7}^{3}={{7\\times 7\\times 7}_{⏟}}_{3\\text{ times}}\n$$\n\nNow, we compute the product. Since $7\\times 7=49,$ we have\n\n$$\n{{7\\times 7}_{⏟}}_{49}\\times 7=49\\times 7.\n$$\n\nFinally, we work out $49\\times 7.$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{aligned} &  & \\,\\,\\,\\,{}_{6}\\,\\,\\,\\, &  \\\\  &  & \\,\\,\\,\\,4\\,\\,\\,\\, & \\,\\,\\,\\,9\\,\\,\\,\\, \\\\ \\,\\,\\,\\,\\times \\,\\,\\,\\, &  &  & \\,\